---
layout: layout.njk
---

<div class="min-h-screen bg-base-100 text-base-content">
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight mb-6">
        Work <span class="text-primary underline">on</span> your organization<br>(not just in it).
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg opacity-80 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
        I help leaders and teams see the hidden constraints that keep their organization from moving where they want it to go.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg opacity-80 mb-10 leading-relaxed">
        Not by adding new frameworks. By removing what's in the way.
      </p>
      <div class="mb-12">
        <img src="/assets/images/StartupWorkshop.jpg" alt="Workshop" class="rounded-2xl shadow-sm w-full object-cover max-h-96" />
      </div>
      <a href="mailto:hello@organifanten.com" class="btn btn-primary text-lg">
        Let's talk
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- POINT OF VIEW -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-accent">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-12 text-center">Three elephants, one approach</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary mb-3">Brain Budget</h3>
          <p class="opacity-90 leading-relaxed">
            Brains conserve energy. Most organizational friction makes sense once you see this.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary mb-3">Via Negativa</h3>
          <p class="opacity-90 leading-relaxed">
            Remove the obstacles before you add another framework. Subtract before you add.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary mb-3">Humble Consulting</h3>
          <p class="opacity-90 leading-relaxed">
            The next step emerges through questions, not prescriptions. That's the only way it sticks.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROOF -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-12 text-center">Who I've worked with</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-8 mb-16 opacity-70">
        <img src="/assets/images/references/Ref_Cargoline.png" alt="Cargoline" class="h-12 w-auto" />
        <img src="/assets/images/references/Ref_Oetker.png" alt="Oetker" class="h-12 w-auto" />
        <img src="/assets/images/references/Ref_Mediaprint.png" alt="Mediaprint" class="h-12 w-auto" />
        <img src="/assets/images/references/Ref_Studyhelp.png" alt="Studyhelp" class="h-12 w-auto" />
        <img src="/assets/images/references/Ref_OEDIV.png" alt="OEDIV" class="h-12 w-auto" />
        <img src="/assets/images/references/Ref_Mettenmeier.png" alt="Mettenmeier" class="h-12 w-auto" />
        <img src="/assets/images/references/Ref_Padersprinter.png" alt="Padersprinter" class="h-12 w-auto" />
        <img src="/assets/images/references/Ref_Quanto.png" alt="Quanto" class="h-12 w-auto" />
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-primary pl-6">
          <p class="text-lg italic opacity-90 leading-relaxed">Man merkt, dass Nicolas über langjährige Erfahrung im Team-Coaching verfügt. Dadurch war er in der Lage in kurzer Zeit ein sehr gutes Gefühl für die relevanten Themen zu bekommen, an welchen für die Weiterentwicklung unseres neu formierten Teams gearbeitet werden musste.</p>
          <footer class="mt-2 text-sm opacity-60">— André, Führungskraft</footer>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-primary pl-6">
          <p class="text-lg italic opacity-90 leading-relaxed">Super war die intensive Betreuung und Gegensteuerung des Prozesses, dies hat den Erfolg abgesichert.</p>
          <footer class="mt-2 text-sm opacity-60">— Günter, Führungskraft</footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONSULTING INVITATION -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-accent">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-6">How I can help</h2>
      <p class="text-lg opacity-90 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        I work with leaders and teams navigating change, recurring friction, or a sense that something is off. Together we find out what's really going on and what to do about it.
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-4 mb-10">
        <p>
          <a href="/consulting/session/" class="text-primary font-semibold hover:underline">Consulting Session</a><br>
          <span class="text-sm opacity-60">90-minute thinking partnership. €500 or €3,000 for a pass of 8.</span>
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="/consulting/change-audit/" class="text-primary font-semibold hover:underline">Change Audit</a><br>
          <span class="text-sm opacity-60">1-week diagnostic with findings document and debrief. €5,000.</span>
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="/consulting/culture-portrait/" class="text-primary font-semibold hover:underline">Culture Portrait</a><br>
          <span class="text-sm opacity-60">1-week culture characterization, before change. €5,000.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="mailto:hello@organifanten.com" class="btn btn-primary">
        Let's talk
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- RESOURCES ENTRY -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6">
        <div class="w-12">{% include "elephant.njk" %}</div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-4 text-center">Free resources</h2>
      <p class="text-lg opacity-80 mb-8 text-center max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Not ready to talk? Start with the DIY Team Building Game—a year of team development challenges, free and facilitatorless.
      </p>
      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="/resources/" class="text-primary font-semibold hover:underline">
          Browse all resources →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "footer.njk" %}

</div>
